{"items":[{"id":"806450615","root":"806447559","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"搜了一下你说的“恩奇都”，发色确实很像[emot=acfun,1658/]。但除此之外好像没有别的相似了。能告诉我这位恩奇都的背景故事吗？","time":1781345950335,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"806621500","root":"806447559","user":{"id":"77879551","name":"浅梦醉川","avatar":"edeb047f35eb1a434bf84a17"},"text":"[emot=acfun,2788/]我来回答一下吧（可能有误喵）\n这里说的恩奇都应该是fate系列中的角色\n在fate/strange fake（FsF）和FGO绝对魔兽战线 中出场\n原型是《吉尔伽美什史诗》中的恩奇都\n在fate系列中主要以Lancer（枪阶）被召唤在与吉尔伽美什（金闪闪）的激战中，两人化敌为友，成为彼此独一无二的挚友。他们一同踏上了无数冒险，最终因击杀神明的“天之公牛”而触怒神明，恩奇都因此身中死之诅咒，以人偶之身重归大地。在FsFZ中以伪Lancer（False Lancer）的身份被召唤，与金闪闪展开了震撼的宝具对决。\n（fate很好看的 力推！！！）","time":1783228639060,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/kc450zvGig-qAbMR3-i2Ifyy-NnuMJr-36baIv.gif?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png"]},"edeb047f35eb1a434bf84a17":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/77879551_747dbb0618094a40a9f8c517b97a3ad5.png","fallbacks":["https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/77879551_747dbb0618094a40a9f8c517b97a3ad5.png"]}},"emotions":{"acfun,1658":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/1658_3c873ae445bd4719be93dc4aca7cc128","fallbacks":[],"name":"迷你AC 19"},"acfun,2788":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/zt-image-host/08ad9187e90810a8b0d9f403","fallbacks":[],"name":"比心"}}}